### 결제 요청
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!@

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
  "amount": 78000
}

### 주문별 결제 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments?orderId=1
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!@

### 결제 콜백 (PG 시뮬레이터가 호출)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionKey": "txn-test-key",
  "orderId": "order-uuid",
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
  "amount": 78000,
  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "reason": "정상 승인되었습니다."
}
